  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
    "Rinse the fish fillets and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic powder, and paprika.",
    "Brush the mixture evenly onto both sides of the fish fillets.",
